The Eiffel Floor Lamp is a natural evolution of the series designed by Krøyer-Sætter-Læssen, grounding the form with a natural stone base. The softly diffused light is dimmable, ensuring the ambiance is right wherever it’s placed; by the bedside, in the hallway, or the living room.
 View technical lighting details here &gt;

  Lighting can not be shipped outside Europe at this time.

