The Eiffel Pendant Light reflects the balance between construction and form made with simplicity in mind. The lamp features a brass metal dimmer switch placed at both the top and bottom of its structure for precisely positioning and controlling the light source, diffusing a warm, soft glow. A simple, uncomplicated design, effortlessly complementing a wide range of settings.
